# Archived work: same rule as results/ -- track the small text that explains or
# reproduces something (write-ups, scripts, submit files), never its output.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!*.md
!*.sh
!*.py
# Former git worktrees: their code is on the worktree-* branches; only the
# run outputs that existed nowhere else are kept here, untracked.
/2026-10-30/worktrees/*/tree/
# Job logs and the per-job scripts generated beside them stay untracked, as they
# were before being archived.
slurm_logs/
!*.patch
